      "title": "Note: MiniMax H3",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MiniMax H3 Reference-to-Video for vlo\n\nThis workflow uses the **vlo MiniMax H3 Reference to Video (Batch)** adapter. Ordered image, video, and standalone-audio references are loaded through the VLO in-memory batch loaders.\n\nReference tags are numbered independently by media type: Picture 1, Video 1, and Audio 1. Reference-video soundtracks create audio references only for the videos whose speaker toggle is on in vlo's video batch slot; the loader delivers those per-video flags alongside the ordered videos. Standalone audio is connected separately; soundtrack override sockets are intentionally unused because audio edits are prepared in vlo.\n\nVLO controls prompt, duration, aspect ratio, resolution, seed, reference image sizing, and embedded video audio through the workflow rules sidecar.\n\nThe sampler decodes the joint MiniMax video/audio latent and muxes both streams into the saved MP4."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## MiniMax H3 Reference-to-Video for vlo\n\nThis workflow uses the **vlo MiniMax H3 Reference to Video (Batch)** adapter. Ordered image, video, and standalone-audio references are loaded through the VLO in-memory batch loaders.\n\nReference tags are numbered independently by media type: Picture 1, Video 1, and Audio 1. Reference-video soundtracks create audio references only for the videos whose speaker toggle is on in vlo's video batch slot; the loader delivers those per-video flags alongside the ordered videos. Standalone audio is connected separately; soundtrack override sockets are intentionally unused because audio edits are prepared in vlo.\n\nVLO controls prompt, duration, aspect ratio, resolution, seed, reference image sizing, and embedded video audio through the workflow rules sidecar.\n\nThe sampler decodes the joint MiniMax video/audio latent and muxes both streams into the saved MP4."
      },
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
